zΔ⚡b|=50e4|+%2DText]] not only finds the longest common subsequence between two text files, but can also spot text moved up and down in the document. Typically diff tools fail to spot moved text and incorrectly label it as either a deletion or addition. Diff%2DText indicates sentence and word re%2Dordering within a paragraph by alternately changing the background from one color to another. It was developed by DiffEngineX LLC in 2008.%0A%0A[[Diff|=11cb|
